                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Early Access VR Player:\nGame's definately early access still. I like the concept of PC vs VR players playing together, but it needs a little work. Specifically, as a VR player, I feel I'm shooting fish in a barral. Specifically, the PC players either can't hit me, or I'm able to take a lot of hits (not sure which), but I'm able to reguarly 1-hit-KO them.  Still, liking the concept, and I think it'll be fun once some of the balance and kinks are worked out.\n\nAlso, standard team-based game needs, being able to see names pointing to people on your team, voice chat, etc. would be really nice.",
